  (text "Burrito measures all of its battery current through R7101 and INA228 U7101 at address 0x40.\nThis works with either its standalone battery or the Churro supply; both routes pass through that shunt.\nFoinse therefore has no duplicate avionics shunt or monitor. This page records that boundary.\nFor Churro measurements, see the propulsion INA228 on f05 (0x41) and pack ADC on f06 (0x48)."
    (at 25.4 53.34 0.0)
